Cairn Skin is a photographic wellness logging tool, not a diagnostic medical
device. It does not screen for, detect, diagnose, or monitor melanoma, skin
cancer, infections, or any dermatological or medical conditions. The visual
similarity score is an on-device mathematical comparison of image feature prints
under varying photographic conditions, not a clinical assessment. Always consult a
board-certified dermatologist or qualified healthcare provider regarding any
skin lesions, changes, or health concerns.
